('Scope and revision','October 2026 website operations. This replaces the May 2026 guide. It covers implemented behaviour; it does not certify that every optional database migration, email provider or scheduled job has been activated. The separate native mobile app project is outside this guide.'),
('Sign in and session expiry','Open /club-admin/login. An active administrator profile and the appropriate role are required. Sessions expire after 10 minutes of inactivity; normal active work renews the inactivity window. After expiry, sign in again before submitting changes. If a page cannot load, reload it and return to login rather than repeatedly submitting a payment action.'),
('My Profile and password','Use My Profile to edit your own name and phone. Email and role are read-only. Change Password requires the current password and a new password of 12-128 characters, followed by a fresh login. Sign out when finished.'),
('Who can do what','Super Admin manages user roles and member maintenance. Admin manages most operating areas but cannot manage users. Both can confirm verified offline payments. Specialist roles are restricted to their assigned areas: news, tournaments/results/absences/live boards, gallery, FAQ, coaching, social posts, or communications. The sidebar and dashboard reflect those permissions. A member role alone has no admin access.'),
