('Recent migrations','20261009_payment_accounts.sql introduces payment account/event linkage. 20261012_tournament_registration_gender.sql adds tournament gender support. 20261013_manual_tournament_payments.sql adds audited offline tournament approval. 20261018_tournament_consent_policy.sql stores policy/photo audit and tightens public access. 20261018_tournament_payment_reminders.sql adds reminder settings, timestamps and failure reason fields. Files are in supabase/migrations/.'),
('Bank transfer migration','Run the complete 20261025_bank_transfer_registration.sql in the AKCC Supabase SQL Editor to activate new membership/tournament bank registrations. It adds payment method, saved bank instructions and reference fields, default account flags, uniqueness protections and audited membership approval. It includes the manual tournament function/receipt audit, so the earlier manual-payment script is not separately required for this feature. It does not mark entries paid.'),
('Legacy columns and verification','Deployed accounts may have account_name, bank_account_name or bank_account_number alongside canonical name/account_number. The current admin API detects each alias independently and copies validated input to all detected aliases on create/update. No further SQL is needed solely for that application compatibility fix. Missing bank schema disables the registration option safely. Verify RLS, service-only RPC grants, existing data preservation and a schema reload before using new features.'),
